---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Nutritious Meal — GWE NGO INDIA"
  description="GWE NGO India provides nutritious meals to destitute elderly people so no elder sleeps empty stomach."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Nutritious Meal</h1>
        <p>Support the elderly, by helping them get a meal!! Try once, it feels good!!</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container prose">
        <p>
          There are thousands of people all over the country who have no choice but to sleep empty
          stomach every night, who don't have a place to live in or clothes to wear, who may have
          pain in their knees due to the cold weather but have nowhere to go to, who may feel lonely
          but have no-one to talk to, no one to share their sorrows with, no one to laugh with. We
          won't even want to think of the life that they are living every day. Right?
        </p>
        <p>
          When we can't even skip a meal, then, how do these elderly people who need nutritious meal
          at this age, sleep empty stomach? They may have to face thousands of difficulties every
          day, may have to beg from hundreds of people all day, who may or may not help them.
          Thinking about all this makes me sad. Don't you feel the same? Have you ever thought what
          goes on in their hearts when people just ask them to move forward and not disturb them?
        </p>
        <p>
          GWE NGO India has a soft corner for elderly people in pain, we want to do as much as
          possible to make them happy and hence we try providing them Nutritious meal so that they
          can live a better life. Why not we all come forward and help them sleep with their
          stomachs full. We may not be able to do a lot, but let's try to do something for them. Our
          little effort may bring back their beautiful smiles for some time. Support the elderly, by
          helping them get a meal!! Try once, it feels good!!
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/donate">Sponsor Meals</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
